From df1a6e85631212022bcad6e76f9136fa0a9741fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:20:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Audit fixes: refresh-rate row, audio switch

- Refresh rate: showing the page with the headset off no longer resets a
  stored rate; the subtitle says when the chosen rate is not offered. The
  popup is re-bound on map and selection so check marks and greyed-out
  entries stay current.
- Audio: USB ids compared without the 0x prefix (PulseAudio reports them
  without it); devices are switched on a background thread that waits up
  to 20 s for the headset's audio to appear; a restart keeps the defaults
  from before the first start.
- Render resolution: a stored value outside 0.30x-1.50x is clamped for the
  caption too.
- EDID parser copy in sync with the driver (checksums, 24-255 Hz).
---
